# ====================================================================
# Body Harvest ROM and derivative binary content — NEVER commit
# ====================================================================
# The ROM is © Gremlin Interactive / DMA Design. Anything derived from
# it (recompiled C, ELF dumps, hashes that fingerprint a specific copy,
# raw save data) is derivative work and stays off-repo. Users supply
# their own ROM.
*.z64
*.n64
*.v64
*.rom
*.ndd

# Recompiler output — generated from the ROM, derivative work.
# Reproduced locally per-user by running N64Recomp against their own
# ROM copy. See docs/BUILDING.md.
bh-recomp/RecompiledFuncs/
bh-recomp/*.elf
bh-recomp/*.bin
bh-recomp/recomp_stderr.txt
bh-recomp/recomp_stdout.txt
bh-app/generated/

# Save files / state snapshots / personal bookmarks — these are 8 MB of
# arbitrary BH RAM and are technically derivative content.
*.sra
*.fla
*.mpk
*.eep
bh_savestate.bin
bh_bookmarks.json
config/

# Hashed ROM identifiers — fingerprints of a specific copy.
*.sha1
*.md5
hash_rom.exe

# Build artifacts
build/
build-*/
out/
*.obj
*.lib
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
install_manifest.txt
Testing/

# Logs from playing / debugging
*.log
bh_watchdog.log

# IDE noise
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.sln
*.vcxproj
*.vcxproj.user
*.vcxproj.filters
.cache/
compile_commands.json

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
ehthumbs.db

# Editor backup files
*~
*.swp
*.swo
.#*
\#*\#

# Local config / scratch
local-config.toml
scratch/
notes-private/
